coverage_notes[3]{id,reason,evidence}:
  call-witness,The signature matrix executes every source-linked name/arity through parse resolve compile and one bounded VM pull; it deliberately does not turn availability into a semantic match.,manual_signature_matrix.rs is the focused public witness
  semantic-output,Section ledgers and focused tests carry exact value ordering empty error flag and process assertions; rows above point to their owning source rather than duplicating verdicts.,manual-completeness is an index not a second verdict ledger
  unresolved,Any referenced campaign failure remains a failure until the campaign or a reviewed disparity changes it; this inventory never approves a disparity.,comparison.toon remains authoritative for verdicts
